1
00:00:14,496 --> 00:00:20,204
Bonjour, Marinette ! Tu vas à la gare en bus ?
Hi, Marinette! Are you going to the train station by bus?

2
00:00:20,304 --> 00:00:25,220
Oui, puis je prends le train. Et toi ?
Yes, then I’m taking the train. And you?

3
00:00:25,320 --> 00:00:29,804
Je vais en métro. Tu as ton billet ?
I’m going by subway. Do you have your ticket?

4
00:00:29,904 --> 00:00:35,012
Oui. Après, on peut louer un vélo.
Yes. After that, we can rent a bicycle.

5
00:00:35,112 --> 00:00:40,604
Bonne idée ! Pour aller sur l’île, on prend un bateau.
Good idea! To go to the island, we’ll take a boat.

6
00:00:40,704 --> 00:00:46,004
D’accord. Je peux aussi prendre un taxi.
Okay. I can also take a taxi.

7
00:00:46,104 --> 00:00:49,412
Et demain, tu viens en avion ?
And tomorrow, are you coming by plane?

8
00:00:49,512 --> 00:00:53,036
Non, je viens en scooter !
No, I’m coming by scooter!
